.TH pvc-stretch 1  "pvc-stretch " 
.SH NAME
pvc\-stretch \- Change duration without changing pitch
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpvc\-stretch\fR <\fB\-\-factor\fR> [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIINPUT\fR> <\fIOUTPUT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Change duration without changing pitch
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-factor\fR \fI<FACTOR>\fR
Time\-stretch factor (`1.0` = unchanged, `2.0` = twice as long)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIINPUT\fR>

.TP
<\fIOUTPUT\fR>

